<urn:atm:triage:RBP-F001-AN15HTTPFUZZ> a triage:Finding ;
    triage:findingId "RBP-F001-AN15HTTPFUZZ" ;
    triage:title "Duplicated case-shape literal tables" ;
    triage:description "rust-best-practices-agent found the case-shape literal tables used by the HTTP fuzz probes are duplicated rather than sharing one definition, in crates/atm-http-runtime (probe/harness code added in commits 4c1dada21/daae40656 on feature/an15-http-fuzz-campaign). Consolidate to a single source of truth." ;
